  },
  "effect_entries": [
    {
      "effect": "Utilisé au combat\n:   Tente de capturer un Pokémon sauvage.  Si c'est actuellement la nuit ou que le Pokémon sauvage a été rencontré en marchant dans une grotte, cette ball a un taux de capture de 3.5×.  Sinon, elle a un taux de capture de 1x.\n\n    Si utilisé pendant un combat de dresseurs, rien ne se passe et la ball est perdue.",
      "short_effect": "Tente de capturer un Pokémon sauvage. Le taux de succès est 3.5× la nuit et dans les grottes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Used in battle\n:   Attempts to catch a wild Pokémon.  If it’s currently nighttime or the wild Pokémon was encountered while walking in a cave, this ball has a catch rate of 3.5×.  Otherwise, it has a catch rate of 1×.\n\n    If used in a trainer battle, nothing happens and the ball is lost.",
      "short_effect": "Tries to catch a wild Pokémon.  Success rate is 3.5× at night and in caves.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "A somewhat different Poké Ball that\nmakes it easier to catch wild Pokémon\nat night or in dark places like caves.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "diamond-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/8/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A somewhat different Poké Ball that\nmakes it easier to catch wild Pokémon\nat night or in dark places like caves.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "platinum",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/9/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A somewhat different Poké Ball that\nmakes it easier to catch wild Pokémon\nat night or in dark places like caves.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "heartgold-soulsilver",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/10/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une Poké Ball efficace pour attraper\nles Pokémon de nuit ou dans des\nendroits sombres tels que les grottes.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A somewhat different Poké Ball that\nmakes it easier to catch wild Pokémon\nat night or in dark places like caves.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A somewhat different Poké Ball that\nmakes it easier to catch wild Pokémon\nat night or in dark places like caves.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "よるや　どうくつなど　くらいところで\nポケモンが　つかまえやすくなる\nちょっと　かわった　ボール。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "밤이나 동굴 등 어두운 곳에서\n포켓몬을 잡기 쉬운\n조금 특이한 볼.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une Poké Ball efficace de nuit ou dans les\nendroits sombres, tels que les grottes.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein mysteriöser Ball, geeignet für Einsätze in der\nNacht oder an dunklen Orten.",
